        <briefdescription>
<para>Constructs an instance of the <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_audio_manager" kindref="compound">AudioManager</ref> class. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This constructor initializes an instance of the <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_audio_manager" kindref="compound">AudioManager</ref> class with a specified audio engine type. It creates an instance of the appropriate audio engine based on the provided type and sets it as the current audio engine for the manager. The log message &quot;Audio Manager Initialized!&quot; is also printed to indicate successful initialization.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Type</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>- The type of audio engine that should be used by this <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_audio_manager" kindref="compound">AudioManager</ref> instance. This can be one of the values defined in the AudioEngineType enum, such as kOpenAL or kFMOD. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
